  "description": "<ul data-start=\"729\" data-end=\"1020\">\r\n<li data-start=\"807\" data-end=\"863\">\r\n<p data-start=\"379\" data-end=\"601\">Deze <strong data-start=\"384\" data-end=\"436\">Apple MacBook Air 13\" Retina (model A1932, 2019)</strong> is in <strong data-start=\"443\" data-end=\"458\">goede staat</strong>, maar wordt verkocht <strong data-start=\"480\" data-end=\"501\">zonder logicboard</strong>.<br data-start=\"502\" data-end=\"505\">Ideaal voor gebruik als <strong data-start=\"529\" data-end=\"549\">onderdelenlaptop</strong> of als <strong data-start=\"557\" data-end=\"575\">donorbehuizing</strong> bij reparatieprojecten.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"603\" data-end=\"825\">Het <strong data-start=\"607\" data-end=\"624\">Retina-scherm</strong>, <strong data-start=\"626\" data-end=\"641\">toetsenbord</strong>, <strong data-start=\"643\" data-end=\"655\">trackpad</strong>, <strong data-start=\"657\" data-end=\"670\">behuizing</strong> en <strong data-start=\"674\" data-end=\"689\">scharnieren</strong> verkeren in nette conditie.<br data-start=\"717\" data-end=\"720\">Perfect voor technici of hobbyisten die een compleet chassis zoeken om een defecte MacBook te herstellen.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"827\" data-end=\"830\">\r\n<h4 data-start=\"832\" data-end=\"857\">⚙️ <strong data-start=\"840\" data-end=\"857\">Specificaties</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"858\" data-end=\"1077\">\r\n<li data-start=\"858\" data-end=\"905\">\r\n<p data-start=\"860\" data-end=\"905\">💻 <strong data-start=\"863\" data-end=\"873\">Model:</strong> MacBook Air 13\" Retina (2019)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"906\" data-end=\"935\">\r\n<p data-start=\"908\" data-end=\"935\">🔢 <strong data-start=\"911\" data-end=\"927\">Modelnummer:</strong> A1932</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"936\" data-end=\"964\">\r\n<p data-start=\"938\" data-end=\"964\">🎨 <strong data-start=\"941\" data-end=\"951\">Kleur:</strong> Space Grey</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"965\" data-end=\"997\">\r\n<p data-start=\"967\" data-end=\"997\">⚙️ <strong data-start=\"970\" data-end=\"985\">Logicboard:</strong> ontbreekt</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"998\" data-end=\"1043\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1000\" data-end=\"1043\">🔋 <strong data-start=\"1003\" data-end=\"1012\">Accu:</strong> aanwezig (staat niet getest)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1044\" data-end=\"1077\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1046\" data-end=\"1077\">🔌 <strong data-start=\"1049\" data-end=\"1059\">Lader:</strong> niet inbegrepen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1079\" data-end=\"1082\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1084\" data-end=\"1281\">📦 <strong data-start=\"1087\" data-end=\"1097\">Staat:</strong> in <strong data-start=\"1101\" data-end=\"1131\">mooie tweedehands conditie</strong>, volledig getest op scherm, toetsenbord en mechanische onderdelen.<br data-start=\"1198\" data-end=\"1201\">Niet werkend uit de doos – bedoeld voor <strong data-start=\"1241\" data-end=\"1280\">onderdelen of logicboard-vervanging</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>",
